UID:de839cb572d8895a5fe04cd92e42a5a84282026_11:08:36_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:SMART Recovery Meeting 
LOCATION:167 Coates Hall, Campus Life , 358J LSU Student Union, Baton Rouge, Louisiana 70803, United States
URL:https://tigerlink.lsu.edu/rsvp?id=2276905
DESCRIPTION:SMART Recovery is a science-based mutual support program that helps individuals build and maintain motivation for change, cope with urges, manage thoughts and behaviors, and live a balanced life. Grounded in principles of Rational Emotive Behavioral Therapy, SMART Recovery focuses on practical tools and skills rather than labels or lifelong identities. Meetings are discussion-based, empowering participants to take an active role in their recovery using evidence-based strategies.\n\nMeeting Link: https://lsu.zoom.us/j/8295821331\n---\nEvent Details: https://tigerlink.lsu.edu/rsvp?id=2276905
END:VEVENT
